      "source": "The default implementation, passing map properties through as they are on the way\nto the graph and possibly applying a post processor on the way out of the graph.",
      "translation": "默认实现会将图属性原样传递至图，并在离开图时可能应用后处理器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Composes the object back from the map.",
