      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Decomposes an object into a map.",
      "translation": "将对象分解为映射。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Decomposes an object into a map. A conversion service is provided in case\ndelegation is needed.",
      "translation": "将对象分解为 Map。如果需要委派，则提供转换服务。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
